{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The award winning and genre defining video game, <strong>Timothy 3</strong>, is finally here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first Timothy-type game you will face a plural amount of\u00a0<i>headache inducing</i> challenges. Some  will rage-quit and refund the game within minutes, while some will think it's a breeze, complete the game and also refund it within minutes. (Please don't).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you\u00a0*<strong>points finger</strong>*, yes you. You will recognize a true masterpiece when you see it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/extras/aa05e22478e8bd537d456a8bb334fbde.poster.avif?t=1761923091\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/extras/aa05e22478e8bd537d456a8bb334fbde.webm?t=1761923091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/extras/aa05e22478e8bd537d456a8bb334fbde.mp4?t=1761923091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY DESCRIPTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a different plane of existence and embody Timothy with only the <i>other</i> voice to guide you. As Timothy, you have 1 minute to complete the task the voice gives you. Frantic running, munching, grabbing, chopping and throwing required. Even jumping is a monumental task for poor Timothy. The game should last for an average playthrough of 30 minutes, while it is possible to complete in the first minute. 100 % achievements may take up to 1,5 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/extras/aa8501564cc63793c0275c232e5328f3.poster.avif?t=1761923091\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/extras/aa8501564cc63793c0275c232e5328f3.webm?t=1761923091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520790/extras/aa8501564cc63793c0275c232e5328f3.mp4?t=1761923091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picking stuff up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throwing said stuff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wood chopping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An awesome narrator</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Coin sniper?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520790/05aea1b3631f6b38646c3f6b43ded36bc389ff07.jpg"},{"name":"Get \"F\"ed.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520790/1dedb8deb510b44d0a14a80e247edbd8bb155db5.jpg"},{"name":"Amazing.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520790/dc749f7f1d4fab4bb30583f7c441f8688c588cb8.jpg"},{"name":"OH NO NO XD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520790/f05e857b45ee2a83fec743846c93ae180e50389e.jpg"},{"name":"Looper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520790/0ac090ac3e096d4f524b4f40faaacde3276fb65c.jpg"},{"name":"Very very frightening.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520790/86ba259494ab16d29eeb34c9390ae743038fd684.jpg"},{"name":"Timothy 3...000?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520790/9e5abf9130bb3c6396c1c60c73a399c03ee5a44b.jpg"},{"name":"Extracurricular.","path":"htt